          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "The Scribe's study: a desk, a lamp, a chair. You\nneed the index fixed: it says 'lost' everywhere."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "Press `Ctrl-v`, then move: a block of columns\nacross every row. Then `d`, `c` or `I`."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
